        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="nb-no">Elkraftfordeling til virksomhet</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">http://bsdd.buildingsmart.org/#concept/details/0QXNqIaY58ARlIeBKvxECI</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">the distribution flow element ifcflowfitting defines the occurrence of a junction or transition in a flow distribution system, such as an elbow or tee. its type is defined by ifcflowfittingtype or its subtypes.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Flow Fitting</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="de-de">Verbinder / Formstück (allgemein)</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="nb-no">koblinger driftsteknisk</rdfs:label>
